{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Reunion"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Blast from the Past"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le18ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Past Time Expressions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">three years ago</span> or <span class=\"italic\">last year</span> when you talk about the past.<br><br>  You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">in 2012</span> when you talk about a year in the past.<br><br>  You use <span class=\"italic\">When I was \u2026 </span> to talk about a period of time."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expression \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" in \u2026 (month or year)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I went to Paris in 2012.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" last \u2026 (day, month, time, etc.) \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> He ripped the jacket last year.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"(number of months or years) \u2026 ago\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I bought this jacket 2 months ago.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Simple Past Tense and Past Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. <br>  You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that     was happening at a time in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br>   Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied. </span><br>  Irregular verbs change in different ways.  <br> For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did </span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask\u2026?.   </span><br> <span class=\"italic\">Did</span> is the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For Past Continuous, we add was/were + verb\u201cing\u201d to verbs.<br>   Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add \u201cing\u201d."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" do \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"did \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were doing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" carry \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"carried\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were carrying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" pay \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"paid \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were paying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" travel \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"traveled \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were traveling\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" rip \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ripped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were ripped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" have \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were having\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I did so much shopping when I was traveling in Europe. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "They were talking when he ripped his jacket."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "personal shopper"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " someone who helps you shop "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I used to get a personal shopper to help me."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about the past experiences."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "millionaire "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who has more than a million dollars "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Life is tough when you're a millionaire."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "budget"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an amount of money you can spend at one time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Peter has budget problems."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "make a long tear or cut in something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter ripped his jacket last year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " You're too much "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Say this when you want to tell someone they are funny "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Oh, Sally. You're too much."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "forgetful "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "likely to forget "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is so forgetful."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, talk about your childhood."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about what you did."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about some good memories."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask follow-up questions to keep the conversation going."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I discuss my childhood with my partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We talk about good memories."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I keep the conversation going."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le18ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Let's not talk about Marco right now!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're right ... I did so much shopping when I was traveling in Europe. The shopping is amazing there!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I bet! How did you carry all your new clothes?", "id": 1, "tim